{"about_the_game":"<strong>Depths Of Horror: Mushroom Day</strong> - is a 3D first-person adventure and horror game that lets you plunge deep into your fears.<br><br>During the <strong>National Mushroom Day</strong> holiday you decided to try your hand at mushroom picking.<br>While picking mushrooms in a clearing, you stumble upon an abandoned hut. Exploring it, you find yourself in a cave full of unexpected inhabitants and &quot;<strong>surprises</strong>&quot;. From this point on, your fight for <strong>survival</strong> begins, which means you have the opportunity to test your wits and endurance.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1590840/extras/21f7f8af0d547738fccb5979db398ab4.avif?t=1728887457\" width=200 height=200 /></span><br><br>Can you find your way out of the cave, bypassing enemies and various obstacles, and gain a worthy <strong>victory</strong> over evil and your fears?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> unique system of hand-crafted caves<br></li><li> frequent events will not make you bored<br></li><li> enemies and screamers<br></li><li> monologues of the main character<br></li><li> interaction with the environment, use of objects<br></li><li> save points<br></li><li> good graphics and great optimization<br></li><li> atmospheric sounds and music<br></li><li> Steam achievements</li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Die by spider","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1590840/ab4ddff60f4aad1060b3161bfd067529faa47a15.jpg"},{"name":"Died by a bomb","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1590840/76a0c09129c28baf24727ab806b8c18b6d02ccf0.jpg"},{"name":"First death","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1590840/c9a3357922fbc9ef2f9bbd2ec14212df86c98abf.jpg"},{"name":"Visit the glade","path":"https://cdn.akamai.st